<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.8000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.8000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.8440 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 5		   Feb 4</p>
<p> High			     75.7900		 75.7700</p>
<p> Low				75.8990		 75.8500</p>
<p> Open			     75.8990		 75.7700</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.8440</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    4.665		   3.265</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Feb 5		   Feb 4</p>
<p> High			     46.2500		 46.6500</p>
<p> Low				46.5000		 46.6500</p>
<p> Open			     46.5000		 46.6500</p>
<p> Close			    46.3100		 46.6500</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	   0.140		   0.005</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
